---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="왁뿌던전 탈출 — UE 5.9 Chaos 물리 파괴 프로젝트"
  description="언리얼 엔진 5.9 내장 Chaos 물리 솔버와 ACharacter를 적극 활용한 20라운드 왁뿌볼 물리 파괴 웨이브 디펜스 프로젝트"
>
  <div class="wp-page">
    <nav class="wp-breadcrumb" aria-label="이동 경로">
      <a href="/learn/projects">Projects</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="current">왁뿌던전 탈출</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="wp-hero">
      <div class="wp-hero-copy">
        <div class="wp-pills">
          <span class="wp-pill status">
            <span class="wp-dot"></span>
            PLANNING · UE 5.9
          </span>
          <span class="wp-pill theme-tag">CHAOS SOLVER × ACHARACTER</span>
          <span class="wp-pill wave-tag">20 WAVES · BOSS ESCAPE</span>
        </div>

        <h1>왁뿌던전 탈출</h1>
        <p class="wp-lead">
          웨이브마다 정해진 수로 등장하는 <strong>왁뿌볼 몬스터</strong>를 가한 힘에 따라 실시간으로 다르게 부서지는
          <strong>Chaos 물리 파괴</strong>로 처치하고, 최종 <strong>20라운드 거대 왁뿌볼</strong>을 격파해 던전에서 탈출하는 UE 5.9 액션 디펜스 프로젝트입니다.
        </p>

        <div class="wp-meta-bar">
          <div class="wp-meta-chip">
            <span class="k">ENGINE</span>
            <span class="v">Unreal Engine 5.9</span>
          </div>
          <div class="wp-meta-chip">
            <span class="k">CORE SOLVER</span>
            <span class="v">Chaos Physics &amp; Destruction</span>
          </div>
          <div class="wp-meta-chip">
            <span class="k">PLAYER BASE</span>
            <span class="v">ACharacter</span>
          </div>
          <div class="wp-meta-chip">
            <span class="k">GOAL</span>
            <span class="v">20 Waves + Giant Boss</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="wp-hero-stage" aria-label="왁뿌볼 인터랙티브 프리뷰">
        <button type="button" class="wp-orb-btn" id="wp-orb-trigger" aria-label="왁뿌볼 눌러보기">
          <span class="wp-orb-shell">
            <span class="wp-orb-shine"></span>
            <span class="wp-orb-core"></span>
            <span class="wp-orb-crack"></span>
          </span>
          <span class="wp-shard s1"></span>
          <span class="wp-shard s2"></span>
          <span class="wp-shard s3"></span>
          <span class="wp-shard s4"></span>
          <span class="wp-shard s5"></span>
          <span class="wp-shard s6"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="wp-stage-caption">
          <span class="wp-stage-badge" id="wp-hit-label">CLICK TO CRACK · 0 / 3</span>
          <span class="wp-stage-sub">힘의 세기에 반응하는 왁스 껍질 × 젤리 코어 컨셉</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="wp-section">
      <div class="wp-section-head">
        <span class="wp-eyebrow">01 // PROJECT OBJECTIVES</span>
        <h2>핵심 프로젝트 목표</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="wp-pillars">
        <article class="wp-pillar chaos">
          <div class="wp-pillar-num">GOAL 01</div>
          <h3>언리얼 내장 Chaos 솔버 적극 활용</h3>
          <p>
            언리얼 엔진 5에 기본 내장된 Chaos 물리·파괴 솔버를 프로젝트의 중심으로 삼습니다.
            단순한 체력 0 → 삭제 방식이 아니라, 캐릭터가 가하는 충격량과 타격 위치에 따라 왁뿌볼이 실시간으로 다르게 반응하고 파편화되는 파괴 경험을 구현합니다.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="wp-pillar character">
          <div class="wp-pillar-num">GOAL 02</div>
          <h3>ACharacter 클래스 적극 활용</h3>
          <p>
            언리얼 기본 캐릭터 클래스(<code>ACharacter</code>)의 이동, 점프, 충돌, 액션 구조를 정석적으로 확장해 사용합니다.
            이전 <code>APawn</code> 중심 프로젝트와 대비되는 캐릭터 기반 액션 설계와 물리 상호작용을 깊이 있게 검증합니다.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wp-section">
      <div class="wp-section-head">
        <span class="wp-eyebrow">02 // CORE GAME LOOP</span>
        <h2>게임 진행 흐름</h2>
      </div>

      <ol class="wp-loop">
        <li>
          <span class="step-idx">01</span>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h3>웨이브 시작</h3>
            <p>라운드마다 정해진 수의 왁뿌볼 몬스터가 던전 내에 스폰됩니다.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="step-idx">02</span>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h3>전투 및 물리 파괴</h3>
            <p>플레이어 캐릭터가 왁뿌볼 몬스터에 힘을 가해 부수며 처치합니다.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="step-idx">03</span>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h3>웨이브 돌파</h3>
            <p>해당 웨이브의 몬스터를 모두 처치하면 다음 라운드로 넘어갑니다.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="step-idx">04</span>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h3>20라운드 거대 왁뿌볼</h3>
            <p>마지막 라운드에 등장하는 거대 왁뿌볼 보스를 격파합니다.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="escape-step">
          <span class="step-idx">05</span>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h3>왁뿌던전 탈출</h3>
            <p>목표 웨이브를 모두 클리어하고 왁뿌던전에서 탈출합니다.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="wp-section">
      <div class="wp-section-head">
        <span class="wp-eyebrow">03 // SYSTEM OUTLINE</span>
        <h2>주요 구성 요소 (큰 틀)</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="wp-grid-3">
        <article class="wp-card">
          <span class="wp-card-tag">PLAYER</span>
          <h3>플레이어 캐릭터 (ACharacter)</h3>
          <p>이동·점프·공격 등 기본 캐릭터 액션을 기반으로 왁뿌볼에 물리적 충격량을 전달하는 주체.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="wp-card">
          <span class="wp-card-tag">MONSTER</span>
          <h3>왁뿌볼 몬스터 (Chaos)</h3>
          <p>가해지는 힘의 세기와 위치에 따라 실시간으로 반응하고 파편으로 부서지는 적 오브젝트.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="wp-card">
          <span class="wp-card-tag">PROGRESSION</span>
          <h3>20라운드 웨이브 &amp; 보스</h3>
          <p>정해진 수의 몬스터를 라운드별로 스폰하며, 최종 20라운드에 거대 왁뿌볼 보스전을 배치.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wp-section">
      <div class="wp-section-head">
        <span class="wp-eyebrow">04 // OPEN DESIGN &amp; ROADMAP</span>
        <h2>추후 구체화 및 포트폴리오 예정</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="wp-roadmap-box">
        <div class="wp-open-list">
          <h3>결정 예정 항목</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>플레이어 주 공격 방식 (근접 타격 / 점프 내려찍기 / 원거리 등)</li>
            <li>게임 오버 조건 (플레이어 생존형 vs 방어 목표 파괴)</li>
            <li>라운드 간 업그레이드·성장 요소 도입 여부</li>
            <li>ASMR 사운드 및 비주얼 연출 디테일</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="wp-log-placeholder">
          <span class="wp-log-badge">NEXT STEP</span>
          <p>
            프로토타입 착수 후 Chaos 파괴 실험, <code>ACharacter</code> 액션 구조, 20라운드 웨이브·보스 구현을 정리한 포트폴리오 페이지가 별도로 추가될 예정입니다.
          </p>
          <a href="/learn/projects" class="wp-back-btn">← 프로젝트 목록</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <script>
    const btn = document.getElementById('wp-orb-trigger');
    const label = document.getElementById('wp-hit-label');
    let hits = 0;

    btn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      hits = (hits + 1) % 4;
      btn.classList.remove('squish', 'cracked-1', 'cracked-2', 'shattered');
      void btn.offsetWidth;

      if (hits === 1) {
        btn.classList.add('squish', 'cracked-1');
        if (label) label.textContent = 'SOFT HIT · 찌그러짐 (1 / 3)';
      } else if (hits === 2) {
        btn.classList.add('squish', 'cracked-2');
        if (label) label.textContent = 'MEDIUM HIT · 국소 균열 (2 / 3)';
      } else if (hits === 3) {
        btn.classList.add('shattered');
        if (label) label.textContent = 'CRITICAL · Chaos 산산조각! (3 / 3)';
      } else {
        if (label) label.textContent = 'CLICK TO CRACK · 0 / 3';
      }
    });
  </script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .wp-page {
    --wp-coral: #ff5e9c;
    --wp-peach: #ff9f43;
    --wp-mint: #2ce6b8;
    --wp-surface: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface-1) 92%, #ff5e9c 8%);
    --wp-surface-soft: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface-2) 90%, #ff9f43 10%);
    --wp-border: color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-coral) 26%, var(--border));
    --wp-glow: 0 18px 44px -18px rgba(255, 94, 156, 0.38);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3.2rem;
  }

  :global([data-theme="light"]) .wp-page {
    --wp-coral: #e12d78;
    --wp-peach: #e07016;
    --wp-mint: #0e9f7d;
    --wp-surface: #fff9fb;
    --wp-surface-soft: #fff4ec;
    --wp-border: rgba(225, 45, 120, 0.22);
    --wp-glow: 0 16px 36px -18px rgba(225, 45, 120, 0.28);
  }

  .wp-breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
    margin-bottom: -1.6rem;
  }
  .wp-breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--text-2);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .wp-breadcrumb a:hover {
    color: var(--wp-coral);
  }
  .wp-breadcrumb .current {
    color: var(--wp-coral);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .wp-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 0.9fr;
    gap: 2.2rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 2.4rem;
    border-radius: 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--wp-border);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 88% 18%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-coral) 18%, transparent), transparent 46%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 12% 92%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-peach) 16%, transparent), transparent 44%),
      var(--wp-surface);
    box-shadow: var(--wp-glow);
  }

  .wp-pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
  }
  .wp-pill {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    padding: 0.28rem 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .wp-pill.status {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.42rem;
    color: var(--wp-coral);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-coral) 14%, transparent);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-coral) 38%, transparent);
  }
  .wp-dot {
    width: 0.46rem;
    height: 0.46rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--wp-coral);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--wp-coral);
  }
  .wp-pill.theme-tag {
    color: var(--wp-peach);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-peach) 13%, transparent);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-peach) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .wp-pill.wave-tag {
    color: var(--wp-mint);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-mint) 12%, transparent);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-mint) 32%, transparent);
  }

  .wp-hero h1 {
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.5rem + 2vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.18;
    background: linear-gradient(125deg, var(--wp-coral), var(--wp-peach) 62%, var(--wp-mint));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .wp-lead {
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 1.04rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .wp-lead strong {
    color: var(--text-1);
  }

  .wp-meta-bar {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }
  .wp-meta-chip {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }
  .wp-meta-chip .k {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .wp-meta-chip .v {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-1);
  }

  .wp-hero-stage {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    padding: 1.8rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface-2) 82%, transparent);
    border: 1px dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-coral) 38%, var(--border));
  }

  .wp-orb-btn {
    position: relative;
    width: 156px;
    height: 156px;
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .wp-orb-shell {
    position: relative;
    width: 132px;
    height: 132px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 32% 28%, #ffd1e6 0%, #ff5e9c 45%, #ff8a3d 100%);
    box-shadow:
      inset -12px -16px 26px rgba(130, 18, 66, 0.35),
      inset 10px 10px 22px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45),
      0 14px 32px -8px rgba(255, 94, 156, 0.55);
    transition: transform 180ms var(--ease), opacity 220ms var(--ease);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }
  .wp-orb-btn:hover .wp-orb-shell {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }
  .wp-orb-shine {
    position: absolute;
    top: 18px;
    left: 24px;
    width: 36px;
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
    transform: rotate(-28deg);
    filter: blur(1px);
  }
  .wp-orb-core {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, #a8ffe9, var(--wp-mint));
    opacity: 0.35;
    transform: scale(0.75);
    transition: opacity 200ms var(--ease), transform 220ms var(--ease);
    box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(44, 230, 184, 0.55);
  }
  .wp-orb-crack {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    opacity: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(125deg, transparent 47%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9) 49%, transparent 51%),
      linear-gradient(42deg, transparent 48%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75) 50%, transparent 52%);
    transition: opacity 180ms ease;
  }

  .wp-orb-btn.squish .wp-orb-shell {
    animation: wp-squish 320ms var(--ease);
  }
  .wp-orb-btn.cracked-1 .wp-orb-crack {
    opacity: 0.45;
  }
  .wp-orb-btn.cracked-2 .wp-orb-crack {
    opacity: 0.95;
  }
  .wp-orb-btn.cracked-2 .wp-orb-core {
    opacity: 0.8;
    transform: scale(0.95);
  }
  .wp-orb-btn.shattered .wp-orb-shell {
    transform: scale(0.55);
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, #c8fff1, var(--wp-mint));
    box-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(44, 230, 184, 0.65);
  }
  .wp-orb-btn.shattered .wp-orb-core {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }

  .wp-shard {
    position: absolute;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 4px 10px 3px 8px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--wp-coral), var(--wp-peach));
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: transform 360ms var(--ease), opacity 360ms var(--ease);
  }
  .wp-orb-btn.shattered .wp-shard {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  .wp-orb-btn.shattered .s1 { transform: translate(-64px, -48px) rotate(-32deg); }
  .wp-orb-btn.shattered .s2 { transform: translate(62px, -50px) rotate(40deg); }
  .wp-orb-btn.shattered .s3 { transform: translate(-72px, 16px) rotate(-65deg); }
  .wp-orb-btn.shattered .s4 { transform: translate(70px, 18px) rotate(55deg); }
  .wp-orb-btn.shattered .s5 { transform: translate(-34px, 64px) rotate(22deg); }
  .wp-orb-btn.shattered .s6 { transform: translate(38px, 62px) rotate(-42deg); }

  @keyframes wp-squish {
    0% { transform: scale(1, 1); }
    35% { transform: scale(1.18, 0.82); }
    70% { transform: scale(0.94, 1.08); }
    100% { transform: scale(1, 1); }
  }

  .wp-stage-caption {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .wp-stage-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--wp-coral);
  }
  .wp-stage-sub {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  .wp-section-head {
    margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
  }
  .wp-eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--wp-coral);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }
  .wp-section-head h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 1.15rem + 0.8vw, 1.85rem);
  }

  .wp-pillars {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.2rem;
  }
  .wp-pillar {
    padding: 1.6rem;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: var(--surface-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .wp-pillar.chaos {
    border-top: 3px solid var(--wp-coral);
  }
  .wp-pillar.character {
    border-top: 3px solid var(--wp-peach);
  }
  .wp-pillar-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--wp-peach);
  }
